 "summary": "The new pairing congruence lemma generalizes Mathlib's `Distribution.ofFun_congr_ae` (scalar `lsmul` pairing only) to any bilinear map, and the change-of-chart lemmas and the `SobolevSection` map have no existing counterpart in Mathlib or TauCeti. The proofs reuse the located existing API (`comp_contDiffOn_diffeo`, `localRep_eventuallyEq_fiberCoordChange_nhds`, `ae_restrict_comp_of_differentiableOn`, `exists_ae_eq_coord`).",
